<title>SPAIN: Spain to announce new electricity framework soon.</title>
<headline>Spain to announce new electricity framework soon.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Industry Minister Josep Pique said on Friday Spain would prepare a new framework for the electricity sector in the coming weeks.  </p>
<p>&quot;We will have a plan put together in just a few weeks,&quot; Pique said at a news conference following the regular cabinet meeting.</p>
<p>The regimen will introduce &quot;complete competition,&quot; Pique said, liberalising both the sources of energy and generation.</p>
<p>--Sharman Esarey, Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
